abstract: >-
  Python/Numba and Rust research implementations of the Generalized Singular
  Approximation method for calculating the effective elastic properties of a
  two-component rock with horizontally aligned inclusions.
keywords:
  - rock physics
  - generalized singular approximation
  - effective-medium modelling
  - anisotropic elasticity
  - computational geophysics
